<title>EU: EP ADOPTS RECOMMENDATION ON ELECTIONS IN ALBANIA.</title>
<headline>EP ADOPTS RECOMMENDATION ON ELECTIONS IN ALBANIA.</headline>
<text>
<p>EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT SESSION NEWS PRESS RELEASE</p>
<p>DOCUMENT DATE: JUNE 13, 1997</p>
<p>*</p>
<p>Elections in Albania - Proposal for a recommendation</p>
<p>(A4-205/97 - Spencer)</p>
<p>*</p>
<p>Friday, 13 June - The recommendation by Tom Spencer (Surrey, EPP) on behalf of the Committee on Foreign Affairs, Security and Defence Policy on the elections in Albania and the role of the multinational protection force was adopted without amendment. END OF DOCUMENT</p>
</text>
